{"id":"vod_sn_35683","vodId":"35683","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"夏之岚 春夏冬中","name_cn":"夏之岚 春夏冬中","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/eb95855c988f3a0c24e3888a8508923a.jpg"},"summary":"八坂一（三瓶由布子 配音）是一位热爱科学的平凡少年，他坚信世界上的一切都可以用科学解释。然而，某一日，八坂一邂逅了名为岚山小夜子（白石凉子 配音）的神秘少女，她的出现以及随后而来的不思议事件颠覆了八坂一的全部世界观。　　两人的相遇令他们获得了穿越回过去的特殊能力，与此同时，女扮男装的上贺茂润（小见川千明 配音）、同样拥有穿越时空的能力的德国少女可雅（名冢佳织 配音）、一直追随着小夜子的墨镜男村田英雄（安元洋贵 配音）、痴情而又倔强的山崎加奈子（堀江由衣 配音）以及身世神秘的少女伏见弥生（野中蓝 配音），这些角色接二连三的出现在八坂一的身边。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:36:49","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZuGc4ECy6C1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Mzd9xma1tn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/r42B86q88x1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ShD4inPq8J1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DnHTr7iqyu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8paw1X1JBG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yviKXphyaN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/u3YgBJrqxU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sjU4kch8EL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/phbRRBKuAB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yFbbp9wrUg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sAX7h4QTt41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bBRESYWtB21/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:31.909Z"}